{"id":"rh8l5i26vqrrzvi6myq678t7e","title":"燕窝市场乱象与科学真相的对比分析","originalTitle":"一盏燕窝的明白账","summary":"燕窝市场存在亚硝酸盐超标问题，科学功效证据不足。血燕通过粪便染色伪造，亚硝酸盐含量最高达11000毫克/千克；燕窝酸含量虽高但人体吸收率低，现有研究仅显示小鼠抗氧化效果。监管要求燕窝亚硝酸盐不得检出，但现行检测方法无法覆盖微量残留。燕窝实际价值在于稀缺性、文化属性及消费者心理，而非直接营养功效。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=52206&do=blog&id=1560585"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T07:13:31.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T13:03:48.982Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T13:03:48.982Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":54,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ff88cdac-3e27-46ad-9bcb-0a3b8dafbb03","title":"燕窝亚硝酸盐超标与功效研究存疑"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ff88cdac-3e27-46ad-9bcb-0a3b8dafbb03","title":"燕窝亚硝酸盐超标与功效研究存疑"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fMBx1kEiQoek","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}